	<entry>
		<title>Example artwork (landscape)</title>
		<link href="https://astrabun.github.io/personal-site-starter/gallery/example-landscape/" />
		<updated>2026-10-12T00:00:00Z</updated>
		<id>https://astrabun.github.io/personal-site-starter/gallery/example-landscape/</id>
		<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://astrabun.github.io/personal-site-starter/img/nTphE6OHry-1200.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;A blue placeholder image with the words &amp;quot;Example artwork, 2400 × 1600&amp;quot;.&quot; width=&quot;1200&quot; height=&quot;800&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A placeholder showing how an artwork page looks. Replace it with your own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each artwork in &lt;code&gt;src/gallery/&lt;/code&gt; is an image plus a Markdown file with the same
name: this one is &lt;code&gt;example-landscape.jpg&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;example-landscape.md&lt;/code&gt;. Anything
you write here, below the front matter, shows up under the image.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delete these examples and add your own with &lt;code&gt;pnpm cms art&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
	</entry>
	<entry>
		<title>Hello, world</title>
		<link href="https://astrabun.github.io/personal-site-starter/posts/2026/10/07/hello-world/" />
		<updated>2026-10-07T00:00:00Z</updated>
		<id>https://astrabun.github.io/personal-site-starter/posts/2026/10/07/hello-world/</id>
		<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the blog! Posts live in &lt;code&gt;src/blog/&lt;/code&gt; and are named
&lt;code&gt;YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md&lt;/code&gt;. Eleventy reads the date from the filename, and the
post is published at &lt;code&gt;/posts/YYYY/MM/DD/slug/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a new one with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-sh&quot;&gt;pnpm cms new
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
</content>
	</entry>
